    <item>
      <title>Orange notification for tropical cyclone SIMON-26. Population affected by Category 1 (120 km/h) wind speeds or higher is 62 .</title>
      <description>From 07/10/2026 to 14/10/2026, a Hurricane/Typhoon &gt; 74 mph (maximum wind speed of 250 km/h) SIMON-26 was active in EastPacific. The cyclone affects these countries: Mexico (vulnerability Medium). Estimated population affected by category 1 (120 km/h) wind speeds or higher is 62 .</description>
      <enclosure type="image/png" length="1" url="https://www.gdacs.org/contentdata/resources/imgtemp/gdacs/tc/1001335/1001335_27_tn.png" />
      <gdacs:temporary>false</gdacs:temporary>
      <link>https://www.gdacs.org/report.aspx?eventtype=TC&amp;eventid=1001335</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 15:33:28 GMT</pubDate>
      <gdacs:dateadded>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 15:33:28 GMT</gdacs:dateadded>
      <gdacs:datemodified>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 02:46:14 GMT</gdacs:datemodified>
      <gdacs:iscurrent>true</gdacs:iscurrent>
