    <item>
      <title>Green notification for tropical cyclone KOGUMA-26. Population affected by Category 1 (120 km/h) wind speeds or higher is 0  (0 in Tropical Storm).</title>
      <description>From 05/10/2026 to 13/10/2026, a Tropical Storm (maximum wind speed of 222 km/h) KOGUMA-26 was active in NWPacific. The cyclone affects these countries: [unknown] (vulnerability [unknown]). Estimated population affected by category 1 (120 km/h) wind speeds or higher is 0  (0 in tropical storm).</description>
